      "y": 434,
      "width": 880.0,
      "height": 56,
      "text": "Request path: Browser cache (HIT 40%) → CDN (HIT 70%) → Redis GET user:123 (HIT 85%) → SELECT * FROM users WHERE id=123\nCache hierarchy: Each tier absorbs misses from the tier before it — DB only sees ~15% of total requests",
